# ============================================================
# Profile A-quality — 1x RTX 5090, quality-oriented
# STATUS: UNTESTED
# ============================================================
# Every value below is a STARTING POINT, not a validated optimum.
# Nothing in this file has been benchmarked on real hardware yet.
# Fill in results/ before changing "UNTESTED" to a measured claim.
# Q5 as the suspected quality/VRAM sweet spot, Q8 KV to reduce KV quant loss.
# Expect lower tok/s than 1x5090-fast. Quantify the tradeoff, don't assume it.
# VRAM estimate: Q5_K_XL is 20.9 GB (verified) + 1.14 GB draft = ~22 GB of a
# 32 GB card, leaving ~10 GB for KV/activations/graphs -- noticeably tighter
# than the Q4 profile. If this OOMs at CTX=131072, lower CTX before lowering
# KV precision, and record which one you changed.
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/_base.env"
MODEL=${MODEL_DIR}/Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q5_K_XL.gguf
GPU=0
PORT=9000
CTX=131072
KV_K=q8_0
KV_V=q8_0
